/**
 * @page module_guide Module Guide
 * @brief Overview of InsightPC runtime modules.
 * @tableofcontents
 *
 * @section module_guide_layers Runtime layers
 *
 * @dot
 * digraph ModuleGuide {
 *   graph [rankdir=LR, bgcolor="transparent", nodesep=0.45, ranksep=0.65];
 *   node [shape=box, style="rounded,filled", color="#7aa2ff", fillcolor="#eef4ff", fontname="Arial"];
 *   edge [color="#5d6b82", arrowsize=0.8];
 *   Launcher -> InsightApplication -> MainController;
 *   MainController -> TabBuilders [label="creates"];
 *   TabBuilders -> SystemInfoService [label="queries"];
 *   SystemInfoService -> OSHI [label="wraps"];
 *   AppSettings -> AppTheme;
 *   AppSettings -> I18N;
 *   MainController -> AppSettings [label="settings dialog"];
 * }
 * @enddot
 *
 * @section module_guide_runtime Runtime flow
 *
 * 1. com.tlcsdm.insightpc.Launcher delegates to the JavaFX application entry point.
 * 2. com.tlcsdm.insightpc.InsightApplication loads the FXML shell, applies saved
 *    preferences, and configures the undecorated stage.
 * 3. com.tlcsdm.insightpc.controller.MainController creates all tab builders and
 *    owns the shared refresh scheduler.
 * 4. com.tlcsdm.insightpc.service.SystemInfoService provides the OSHI facade used
 *    by tab builders.
 */
